      "prompt": "Tales Untold Buffer Refill — Monday & Thursday Edition\n\nCheck the current Buffer queue for Tales Untold YouTube channel. If fewer than 6 posts are scheduled:\n\n**Phase 1: Story Topic Generation**\n- Check ~/.openclaw/workspace/tales-untold/queue/ folder — if fewer than 10 topics exist, write new ones\n- Create 10 fresh horror micro-story topics (one-liners)\n- Save as queue/XX_topic_name.txt files\n\n**Phase 2: Video Production**\n- Run Spielberg pipeline on all new queue topics\n- Generate: story → Adam voice → Whisper → Gammell scenes → HTML → HyperFrames → ffmpeg\n- Produce FINAL_*.mp4 files in output/\n\n**Phase 3: Upload to Drive**\n- Upload videos to Google Drive folder 1EbHh1_zhHDVX2YAO2i7yV_3epwUvNppj\n- Get public URLs: https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=XXX\n\n**Phase 4: Schedule via Dual-Account Script**\nUse the buffer_dual_account.py script with explicit token:\n\n```python\npython3 ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/buffer_dual_account.py post-youtube \\\n  \"TITLE\" \\\n  \"DRIVE_URL\" \\\n  \"DESCRIPTION #shorts #horror\"\n```\n\nSchedule 3 per day at: 6 PM, 7 PM, 8 PM ET\nStop when Buffer reaches 9-10 posts.\n\n**Tokens are stored in script - DO NOT ask user for tokens.**\n\nReport: posts created, scheduled times, Buffer fill level",
